        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Puma evoPOWER football boots\n- Companies: Puma\n- People: Cesc Fàbregas, Marco Reus, Mario Balotelli\n- Roles: Central midfielder\n- Organizations: Chelsea, Spain national team\n\nFacts:\n- Puma first released the Puma evoPOWER range of football boots in January 2014.\n- Puma is a German sportswear manufacturer that developed the Puma evoPOWER football boots.\n- Puma marketed the evoPOWER with Cesc Fàbregas, Marco Reus, and Mario Balotelli.\n- Cesc Fàbregas was born on 4 May 1987.\n- Cesc Fàbregas is a Spanish professional footballer.\n- Cesc Fàbregas plays as a central midfielder for Chelsea and the Spain national team.",
